<P STYLE="margin: 0 0 12pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 117.35pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">(vi)
Pursuant to the Defend Trade Secrets Act of 2016, the Company and Executive hereby confirm, understand and acknowledge that Executive
