property, copyright, trademark, trade secret, unfair competition, other intellectual property laws, and related laws) to the Company
Group members to the extent ownership of any such rights does not vest originally in such Company Group members whether as a &#8220;work
made for hire&#8221; or by virtue of the prior sentence. If Executive creates any written records (in the form of notes, sketches, drawings,
