ownership rights set forth in this Section 7, including by filing to register any Company Group Works in Executive&#8217;s own name.</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="margin: 0 0 12pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 117.35pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">(iii)
