<P STYLE="margin: 0 0 12pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">8.
<B><U>Specific Performance</U></B>. Executive acknowledges and agrees that the remedies of the Company Group at law for a breach or threatened
breach of any of the provisions of Section 6 and Section 7 of this Agreement would be inadequate and the Company Group would suffer irreparable
damages as a result of such breach or threatened breach. In recognition of this fact, Executive agrees that, in the event of such a material
breach, in addition to any remedies at law, any member of the Company Group, without posting any bond, shall be entitled, in addition
